Package: GiottoKernels
Title: Optional Compiled Kernels for the Giotto Suite
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("George", "Chen", , "jiajic@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small compiled compute kernels for the Giotto suite. Each takes
    plain vectors or an Arrow C stream and returns plain vectors, and knows
    nothing about Giotto's classes. Every kernel is optional: the calling
    package checks has_kernel() and otherwise runs its own R implementation,
    so installing this package only changes speed, never results beyond
    floating-point rounding.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/giotto-suite/GiottoKernels
BugReports: https://github.com/giotto-suite/GiottoKernels/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.65
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    nanoarrow,
    parallel
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
